1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 24=

2
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,640
Official Huang,

3
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,720
what brings you here?

4
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,180
I'm here under orders

5
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,450
to transfer prisoners for trial.

6
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:23,080
Where are Jiang Xiaobai and Songpiao?

7
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:24,560
Inside.

8
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,200
Take me there.

9
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,000
Yes, sir.

10
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:43,840
Come here.

11
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,720
Open these two cell doors.

12
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,200
Yes, sir.

13
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,120
Official Huang...

14
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,000
Cut the talk.

15
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,000
Get out here, quick.

16
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,200
The officials are waiting for you.

17
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,600
You too.

18
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,480
Out.

19
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:14,720
Move.

20
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:16,520
What are you looking at?

21
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,280
Move it!

22
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,560
Move!

23
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,520
Where are the two prisoners?

24
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,400
Official Huang just took them away.

25
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,000
What?

26
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,080
Oh no.

27
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,000
We can't let them escape.

28
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,040
After them, now!

29
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:38,520
Yes, sir.

30
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,360
Halt.

31
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,840
Hurry!

32
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,440
Halt.

33
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,000
Run!

34
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,760
Official Huang.

35
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,600
Master.

36
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,480
Let go.

37
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,600
Official Huang.

38
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,200
Let go of me.

39
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:06,720
Go.

40
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:07,800
Go.

41
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,920
Master.

42
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:11,040
- Just go, Master.
- Let go.

43
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,440
Hurry.

44
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,160
Let go.

45
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,760
Master, run.

46
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,960
- Otherwise, my death will be in vain!
- Let go.

47
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,760
Take my master and get out of here.

48
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,160
Let go.

49
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,920
Go.

50
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,760
Hurry, go!

51
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,440
Let go.

52
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:27,960
Get out of the way!

53
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,240
Miss Xiaobai.

54
00:03:33,330 --> 00:03:33,890
No.

55
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:46,560
Master...

56
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,320
Hurry, go...

57
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,040
Go!

58
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,160
On

59
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,040
behalf of the people and Qiniang,

60
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,160
I thank you,

61
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,720
Advocate Jiang.

62
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,080
Miss Xiaobai,

63
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:17,800
I am sorry.

64
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,120
Before Sizhou died,

65
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,680
he asked us not to seek revenge.

66
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,960
But I can't do it.

67
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,200
He was a good person,

68
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,600
but I am not.

69
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,840
Your Highness,

70
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,760
Huang Wangde,
Prefect of the Zhaoming Office,

71
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,590
went to the prison
with a forged imperial decree,

72
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:49,360
trying to break
the two key prisoners out.

73
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,520
Were they caught?

74
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:54,240
Huang Wangde was killed on the spot.

75
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,320
Jiang Xiaobai and Songpiao escaped.

76
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,760
Let them be.

77
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,320
As long as

78
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,360
they never show up
in Bojue Kingdom again.

79
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,360
Alright.

80
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,760
You may leave.

81
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,720
I am tired

82
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,360
and wish to be left alone.

83
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,190
Yes, Your Highness.

84
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,600
Songpiao...

85
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,560
(Security has been tight
in the city recently.)

86
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,720
(Miss Xiaobai,
please lay low for a few days)

87
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,000
(before finding a chance to leave town.)

88
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,640
(In the end,
I failed my brother's request.)

89
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,400
(Forgive me.)

90
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:55,810
Prince Luan,
Songpiao requests an audience.

91
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,080
(Today, all the ministers)

92
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:04,000
(congratulated me,
calling this Heaven's decree.)

93
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,200
(I fed on my own flesh and blood)

94
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:09,800
(so that the people of this realm
wouldn't eat their own children.)

95
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,400
(Is this what
they call Heaven's decree?)

96
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:14,640
(If it were Zhou,)

97
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,680
(what would he think?)

98
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,600
(What would he do?)

99
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,400
(Or perhaps...)

100
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,800
The ritual following
the coronation ceremony

101
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,200
has been arranged.

102
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,400
The full schedule

103
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,480
is right here.

104
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:36,040
Thank you, Prince Luan.

105
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,000
It is only my duty.

106
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,240
I shall take my leave.

107
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,880
By the grace of Heaven,

108
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,280
the Emperor decrees.

109
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,840
The late Emperor has passed away,

110
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,440
and the throne must pass to a successor.

111
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,080
Empress Jingshu

112
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,760
embodies supreme virtue

113
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,240
and boundless benevolence.

114
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,240
In accordance
with Heaven and the people,

115
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,160
we bestow upon Empress Jingshu

116
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:08,040
the imperial seal and ribbon.

117
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,080
She shall ascend the throne this day.

118
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,560
All officials, inside and out,

119
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,240
shall unite with one heart

120
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,120
to support the new reign.

121
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,160
Thus decreed.

122
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,160
Bow.

123
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:39,840
- Long live Your Majesty.
- Long live Your Majesty.

124
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:52,740
(Xiangyang)

125
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,840
Lower the palanquin.

126
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,920
Open the city gates.

127
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:56,960
Get out of the way.

128
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,720
I have come to congratulate you

129
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,400
on ascending the throne, Mother.

130
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,760
What do you want to do?

131
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,080
Take your life.

132
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,480
Jiang Xiaobai,

133
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:45,920
who sent you here?

134
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,280
Songpiao,

135
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,680
how do you plan to end this today?

136
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,120
Kill her.

137
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:52,880
Even if you kill her,

138
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:53,720
they won't come back.

139
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,480
I don't care.

140
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,480
I care!

141
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,600
Sizhou cares too.

142
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:08,680
And of course,

143
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,120
you care as well.

144
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,000
I was too naive.

145
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,280
I thought you could
accomplish great things,

146
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,160
but I was wrong.

147
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,320
The laws I revised for you
served as a tool

148
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,440
for you to deceive the world

149
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:23,440
and pave your bloody path to coronation.

150
00:10:23,970 --> 00:10:25,480
To achieve your goals,

151
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,440
you used any means necessary,

152
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,360
even discarding your own flesh and blood

153
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,880
at any moment.

154
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,080
Jingshu,

155
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,520
do you really think
a reign built on torture

156
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,200
can ever be secure?

157
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,160
Good and evil
will be rewarded in the end.

158
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,360
Everyone must pay the price

159
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,400
for their choices.

160
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,080
You have no way back.

161
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,240
One more wrong step,

162
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,400
and it will be the abyss.

163
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,400
Take care of yourself.

164
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:58,460
(Jingshu died of a severe illness
the day after ascending the throne)

165
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,680
The new ruler of the Bojue Kingdom,

166
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,120
Empress Jingshu,

167
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,320
fell gravely ill

168
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,640
the day after her ascension

169
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,000
and passed away despite treatment.

170
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,280
Heaven's will is unpredictable,

171
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,640
and the nation mourns together.

172
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,600
(Imperial Decree)
This is hereby announced to the world.

173
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:11,120
Let all subjects know,

174
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,480
stay in their places,

175
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,120
and protect the foundation
of the state together.

176
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,200
(Everything has ended.)

177
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:21,080
(It is as if nothing ever happened.)

178
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:22,960
(Did Jingshu succeed?)

179
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,760
(I don't think so.)

180
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,520
(All men perish along with their fame,)

181
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,880
(yet the mighty rivers flow on forever.)

182
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,320
(I can change
the system of Bojue Kingdom,)

183
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,560
(but I cannot change
the souls under it.)

184
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:37,320
(Though my presence is like an ant
trying to shake a giant tree,)

185
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,520
(I hope I can sow a seed)

186
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,540
(of faith in the law for Bojue Kingdom.)

187
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:43,420
(Tomb of Songpiao and Rousang)
(This seed,)

188
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,680
(perhaps one day,)

189
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,800
(will break through
the soil and sprout.)

190
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,800
(The mountains and rivers
have green fields,)

191
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,800
(and the world has peaceful nights.)

192
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,400
(Sizhou,)

193
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,760
(your wish will come true.)

194
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:01,000
(To come to this world,)

195
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,880
(one must see
the sky full of rosy clouds,)

196
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,720
(smell the fragrance of field flowers,)

197
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,560
(and listen to the singing of birds.)

198
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,640
(This universe,
these mountains and rivers,)

199
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,120
(and every bit of life.)

200
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:12,920
(If you plant flowers in your heart,)

201
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,800
(life will not be desolate.)

202
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:17,120
(If the darkness
dares to stand in the way,)

203
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,600
(be the light
that tears through the night.)

204
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:24,980
(Bonus scene to follow,
please do not leave)

205
00:12:27,730 --> 00:12:30,330
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

206
00:12:31,290 --> 00:12:33,690
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

207
00:12:34,330 --> 00:12:36,090
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

208
00:12:36,090 --> 00:12:39,010
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

209
00:12:41,450 --> 00:12:43,890
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

210
00:12:44,250 --> 00:12:47,570
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

211
00:12:48,170 --> 00:12:49,730
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

212
00:12:49,890 --> 00:12:53,210
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

213
00:12:55,970 --> 00:12:58,850
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

214
00:12:59,370 --> 00:13:02,450
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

215
00:13:02,890 --> 00:13:05,490
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

216
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:09,530
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

217
00:13:09,770 --> 00:13:12,810
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

218
00:13:13,210 --> 00:13:15,890
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

219
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:18,610
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

220
00:13:18,890 --> 00:13:21,850
♪I'll only say that once♪

221
00:13:22,330 --> 00:13:24,090
♪I called your name♪

222
00:13:28,690 --> 00:13:30,930
♪The silent stars hang low♪

223
00:13:32,330 --> 00:13:34,530
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

224
00:13:35,770 --> 00:13:37,690
♪I linger in the old tower♪

225
00:13:37,810 --> 00:13:41,450
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

226
00:13:42,770 --> 00:13:45,210
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

227
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:48,890
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

228
00:13:49,650 --> 00:13:51,890
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

229
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:58,130
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

230
00:13:58,410 --> 00:14:01,290
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

231
00:14:01,890 --> 00:14:05,370
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

232
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:08,010
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

233
00:14:08,010 --> 00:14:12,290
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

234
00:14:12,290 --> 00:14:15,210
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

235
00:14:15,650 --> 00:14:18,370
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

236
00:14:18,370 --> 00:14:21,050
♪If we meet again in another life♪

237
00:14:21,370 --> 00:14:24,090
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

238
00:14:24,770 --> 00:14:27,050
♪Was when we first met?♪

239
00:14:28,330 --> 00:14:30,730
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

240
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:33,610
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪

241
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,120
Slow down.

242
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,400
Watch your step.

243
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:55,040
This way.

244
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:55,840
Slow down.

245
00:14:57,130 --> 00:15:00,440
♪I used to think
romantic moments came so easily♪

246
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:01,880
Your hat dropped.

247
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,750
♪Laughing at how restless
mortal joys and sorrows were♪

248
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:05,880
Come, let me carry you.

249
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,360
Thank you.

250
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,640
You're so heavy.

251
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,320
Come on, sweetie.

252
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:14,320
Thank the lady.

253
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:15,600
Say thank you.

254
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:16,920
Thank you.

255
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,880
Bye-bye.

256
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,200
Goodbye.

257
00:15:23,590 --> 00:15:26,350
♪Those missed chances, those hurts♪

258
00:15:26,650 --> 00:15:30,100
♪Surge late at night
into a sea of bitterness♪

259
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,600
Hello.

260
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:36,240
♪It turns out all the prosperity
was just an arrangement♪

261
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:40,550
♪Only through pain do I know
what is truly worth loving♪

262
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:44,810
♪Put away pride,
let go of all dependence♪

263
00:15:44,810 --> 00:15:49,090
♪A journey through the world
finally brings understanding♪

264
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,080
Excuse me,

265
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:52,760
how do I get to Neverland?

266
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,780
♪Treating the world as a game♪

267
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:56,040
I'll take you there.

268
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:59,380
♪Until hardship tears
the heart wide open♪

269
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:03,980
♪Only then to realize love, hate,
and farewells are preordained♪

270
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:06,820
(The End)
